#: dialogs/msg-box-dialog.slint:91
msgctxt "MsgBoxDialog"
msgid ""
"Failed to load the account list: the account configuration file is invalid. "
"Check account.json or add the account again."
msgstr "无法加载账号列表：账号配置文件无效。请检查 account.json 或重新添加账号。"

#: dialogs/msg-box-dialog.slint:94
msgctxt "MsgBoxDialog"
msgid "No login session was found. Please log in again."
msgstr "未找到登录会话。请重新登录。"

#: dialogs/msg-box-dialog.slint:97
msgctxt "MsgBoxDialog"
msgid ""
"The network client returned an error. Check the download source settings and "
"retry."
msgstr "网络客户端返回错误。请检查下载源设置后重试。"

#: dialogs/msg-box-dialog.slint:100
msgctxt "MsgBoxDialog"
msgid ""
"Connection failed. Check your network connection and the download source "
"settings."
msgstr "连接失败。请检查网络连接和下载源设置。"

#: dialogs/msg-box-dialog.slint:103
msgctxt "MsgBoxDialog"
msgid "The target directory is not empty. Choose an empty directory."
msgstr "目标目录非空。请选择一个空目录。"

#: dialogs/msg-box-dialog.slint:106
msgctxt "MsgBoxDialog"
msgid ""
"Download failed. Check your network connection and the download source "
"settings, then retry."
msgstr "下载失败。请检查网络连接和下载源设置后重试。"

#: dialogs/msg-box-dialog.slint:109
msgctxt "MsgBoxDialog"
msgid "The target file already exists. Delete or rename it and retry."
msgstr "目标文件已存在。请删除或重命名后重试。"

#: dialogs/msg-box-dialog.slint:112
msgctxt "MsgBoxDialog"
msgid "A file is in use by another program. Close the program and retry."
msgstr "文件正被其他程序占用。请关闭该程序后重试。"

#: dialogs/msg-box-dialog.slint:115
msgctxt "MsgBoxDialog"
msgid "A required file was not found. It may have been moved or deleted."
msgstr "找不到所需文件。该文件可能已被移动或删除。"

#: dialogs/msg-box-dialog.slint:118
msgctxt "MsgBoxDialog"
msgid ""
"The Minecraft version configuration is invalid. Re-add the version or check "
"its JSON file."
msgstr "Minecraft 版本配置无效。请重新添加该版本或检查其 JSON 文件。"

#: dialogs/msg-box-dialog.slint:121
msgctxt "MsgBoxDialog"
msgid "The operation was interrupted."
msgstr "操作已中断。"

#: dialogs/msg-box-dialog.slint:124
msgctxt "MsgBoxDialog"
msgid ""
"The Java path configuration is invalid. Check the configured Java "
"installation path."
msgstr "Java 路径配置无效。请检查已配置的 Java 安装路径。"

#: dialogs/msg-box-dialog.slint:127
msgctxt "MsgBoxDialog"
msgid "No Java executable was found at the configured path."
msgstr "在配置的路径下找不到 Java 可执行文件。"

#: dialogs/msg-box-dialog.slint:130
msgctxt "MsgBoxDialog"
msgid ""
"The Java release file is invalid. Check the Java installation or reinstall "
"Java."
msgstr "Java 的 release 文件无效。请检查 Java 安装或重新安装 Java。"

#: dialogs/msg-box-dialog.slint:133
msgctxt "MsgBoxDialog"
msgid ""
"The launcher configuration (config.json) is invalid. Fix or delete it and "
"restart the launcher."
msgstr "启动器配置（config.json）无效。请修复或删除该文件后重启启动器。"

#: dialogs/msg-box-dialog.slint:136
msgctxt "MsgBoxDialog"
msgid "The saved login data is invalid. Please log in again."
msgstr "已保存的登录数据无效。请重新登录。"

#: dialogs/msg-box-dialog.slint:139
msgctxt "MsgBoxDialog"
msgid "The network is unavailable. Check your network connection."
msgstr "网络不可用。请检查网络连接。"

#: dialogs/msg-box-dialog.slint:142
msgctxt "MsgBoxDialog"
msgid ""
"Permission denied. Check the permissions of the launcher data directory."
msgstr "权限不足。请检查启动器数据目录的权限。"

#: dialogs/msg-box-dialog.slint:145
msgctxt "MsgBoxDialog"
msgid "A network request failed. Check your network connection and retry."
msgstr "网络请求失败。请检查网络连接后重试。"

#: dialogs/msg-box-dialog.slint:148
msgctxt "MsgBoxDialog"
msgid ""
"The launcher's internal communication failed. Please restart the launcher."
msgstr "启动器内部通信失败。请重启启动器。"

#: dialogs/msg-box-dialog.slint:151
msgctxt "MsgBoxDialog"
msgid ""
"The launcher's internal state synchronization failed. Please retry or "
"restart the launcher."
msgstr "启动器内部状态同步失败。请重试或重启启动器。"

#: dialogs/msg-box-dialog.slint:154
msgctxt "MsgBoxDialog"
msgid "The selected item no longer exists. Refresh the list and try again."
msgstr "所选项目已不存在。请刷新列表后重试。"

#: dialogs/msg-box-dialog.slint:157
msgctxt "MsgBoxDialog"
msgid "The download task was not found. It may have finished or been removed."
msgstr "找不到该下载任务。它可能已完成或被删除。"

#: dialogs/msg-box-dialog.slint:160
msgctxt "MsgBoxDialog"
msgid "An unknown error occurred. Check the log for details."
msgstr "发生未知错误。请查看日志了解详情。"

